{
  "page": 526,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4785,
      "text": "By the star when it sets,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4786,
      "text": "Your companion [i.e., the Prophet] has neither strayed nor is he deluded.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4787,
      "text": "Nor does he speak out of his own desire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4788,
      "text": "It is but a revelation sent down [to him].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4789,
      "text": "He was taught by [an angel of] mighty power[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4790,
      "text": "and of great perfection[2], who manifested himself [in his true form][3]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4791,
      "text": "when he was on the higher horizon[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4792,
      "text": "Then he approached [the Prophet] and descended,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4793,
      "text": "until he was only two bow-lengths away or even closer.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4794,
      "text": "Then he revealed to His slave[5] what he had to reveal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4795,
      "text": "The [Prophet’s] heart[6] did not deny what he saw.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4796,
      "text": "Do you dispute with him concerning what he saw?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4797,
      "text": "He certainly saw him a second time[7]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4798,
      "text": "at the Lote Tree of the Utmost Boundary [in the seventh heaven]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4799,
      "text": "near which is the Garden of Abode,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4800,
      "text": "when the Lote Tree was overwhelmed with [divine] splendors.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4801,
      "text": "His gaze did not wander, nor did it look beyond the limit.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4802,
      "text": "He certainly saw some of the greatest signs of his Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4803,
      "text": "Have you [O disbelievers] thought about [the idols of] Lāt and ‘Uzzā,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4804,
      "text": "and Manāt, the third one as well[8]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4805,
      "text": "Do you choose for yourselves males and for Him females?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4806,
      "text": "That is then an unfair division!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4807,
      "text": "These [idols] are no more than names you and your forefathers have made up[9], for which Allah has not sent down any authority. They follow nothing but conjecture and what their souls desire, although there has come to them guidance from their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4808,
      "text": "Is it that man can get whatever he wishes for[10]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4809,
      "text": "Rather, to Allah belongs the Hereafter and this world.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 460,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4810,
      "text": "How many angels there are in the heavens whose intercession will be of no avail except after Allah’s permission to whom He wills and pleases.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 526,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "en"
}
